docs/_build/
docs/html/
docs/doxygen/
docs/sphinx/

# Backup
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
*.save
.#*
\#*\#

# lock staging: preimages stay local until the call is scored (see predictions/VERIFY.md)
locks/
